\par The base genetic matrix pool contains the makings for 17 Bioderms and three protoderms which you must purchase to pilot your Hercs. As you progress through the Commander Ranks you will be incrementally rewarded with ten \uldb \cf2 unique Bioderms\plain\fs20\cf2 {\v NJUEKN}\cf1 , as well as other tactical advantages. The Bioderm stats include their vital statistics along with their skill ratings and learning curves. The lower the number for the learning curve, the faster that Bioderm will improve at that skill.
\par \pard\li175 
