\par\intbl Maia and her fraternal twin Qabal (See: \uldb \cf2 Qabal\plain\fs20\cf2 {\v 4L5BU.}\cf1 ) were born on Luna\'92s Tyco-city shortly before it was destroyed in a devastating Cybrid attack. Their parents were killed, and they were separated in the raid, Maia going to Mars, Qabal into the outer solar system. Maia was adopted by a military family, and her step-father was killed in combat when she was sixteen. Losing a third parent to the Cybrids devastated her, and she vowed to become a Herc Warrior like him and do everything she could to end their killing. Gifted with intelligence and great manual dexterity, she excelled as a pilot, engineer, and weapons master.
\par\intbl 
\par\intbl During the Battle of the Antarctic, she was reunited with Qabal. Feeling a special bond, they became fast friends, and when an opportunity arose, they transferred to the same unit, becoming a legendary combat team. Only later did they learn that they were long lost brother and sister.
\par\intbl \par\pard \pard\intbl\tx1705\tx2695\tx3955\tx5395\tx6925 It is unknown how much of the original Maia\'92s personality will be found in her namesake Bioderm. The original Maia excelled in abstract thought and scientific theory, and it is this facet that has been enhanced to enable her namesake Bioderm to learn at an almost superhuman rate.\plain\fs20 
